    <h1>Education Context: <em>what models are</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      PondScope helps visitors understand AI models by connecting familiar ideas to a living ecosystem. This
      page is an <b>additive</b> learning path. All existing sections, labs, glossary entries, metaphors,
      sources, and navigation remain intact.
    </p>

    <nav class="jump-row" aria-label="Jump on this page">
      <a href="#what-models">What models are</a>
      <a href="#popular">Popular models</a>
      <a href="#adapters">Adapters</a>
      <a href="#huggingface">Hugging Face</a>
